<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Boomerang"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Imagine Dragons"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Origins (Deluxe)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71816158"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1437948981"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">我们究竟要诉尽多少谎言</text><text for="L2">去不停重复着我是希望你好</text><text for="L3">不知说过多少次要忘记从前</text><text for="L4">有多少次虚妄错觉不停浮现</text><text for="L5">不停浮现</text><text for="L6">我知道 明朝我总会与你再相见</text><text for="L7">我无比遗憾就这样让你走 就这样放手</text><text for="L8">就这样让你走 就这样放手</text><text for="L9">忘记从前 坚定向前</text><text for="L10">我已准备好 准备好要向前</text><text for="L11">我已准备好 准备好要放手告别</text><text for="L12">而你却如那回旋镖 反复打回心间</text><text for="L13">而你却如那回旋镖 反复浮现眼前</text><text for="L14">我们究竟要掉多少滴泪</text><text for="L15">要耗尽多少个孤寂失眠的夜</text><text for="L16">才能让一切圆满 而这又是否值得付出一切</text><text for="L17">我们能否就此告别向前</text><text for="L18">亦或转身沉溺从前</text><text for="L19">我知道 明朝我总会与你再相见</text><text for="L20">我无比遗憾就这样让你走 就这样放手</text><text for="L21">就这样让你走 就这样放手</text><text for="L22">忘记从前 坚定向前</text><text for="L23">我已准备好 准备好要向前</text><text for="L24">我已准备好 准备好要放手告别</text><text for="L25">而你却如那回旋镖 反复打回心间</text><text for="L26">而你却如那回旋镖 反复浮现眼前</text><text for="L27">这一切并不容易 但也并不代表一切就毫无意义</text><text for="L28">我们始终在为这一切努力 长久以来拼尽了全力</text><text for="L29">Ooh</text><text for="L30">而你却如那回旋镖 反复打回心间</text><text for="L31">Ooh</text><text for="L32">而你却如那回旋镖 反复浮现眼前</text><text for="L33">而你却如那回旋镖 反复打回心间</text><text for="L34">而你却如那回旋镖 反复浮现眼前</text><text for="L35">就这样让你走 就这样放手</text><text for="L36">就这样让你走 就这样放手</text><text for="L37">忘记从前 坚定向前</text><text for="L38">忘记从前 坚定向前</text><text for="L39">我已准备好 准备好要向前</text><text for="L40">我已准备好 准备好要放手告别</text><text for="L41">而你却如那回旋镖 反复打回心间</text><text for="L42">而你却如那回旋镖 反复浮现眼前</text><text for="L43">就这样让你走 就这样放手</text><text for="L44">就这样让你走 就这样放手</text><text for="L45">忘记从前 坚定向前</text><text for="L46">忘记从前 坚定向前</text><text for="L47">我已准备好 准备好要向前</text><text for="L48">我已准备好 准备好要放手告别</text><text for="L49">而你却如那回旋镖 反复打回心间</text><text for="L50">而你却如那回旋镖 反复浮现眼前</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Dan Reynolds</songwriter><songwriter>Wayne Sermon</songwriter><songwriter>Ben McKee</songwriter><songwriter>Daniel Platzman &amp; Jorgen Odegard</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:02.918"><div begin="0:20.200" end="3:02.918"><p begin="0:20.200" end="0:24.970" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.200" end="0:20.470">How</span> <span begin="0:20.470" end="0:20.980">many</span> <span begin="0:20.980" end="0:22.450">lies</span> <span begin="0:22.450" end="0:22.660">do</span> <span begin="0:22.660" end="0:22.900">we</span> <span begin="0:22.900" end="0:23.230">have</span> <span begin="0:23.230" end="0:23.350">to</span> <span begin="0:23.350" end="0:24.730">tell?</span></p><p begin="0:24.970" end="0:29.830" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.970" end="0:25.270">To</span> <span begin="0:25.270" end="0:25.690">keep</span> <span begin="0:25.690" end="0:25.780">on</span> <span begin="0:25.780" end="0:27.250">saying,</span><span begin="0:27.280" end="0:27.550">that</span> <span begin="0:27.550" end="0:27.700">I</span> <span begin="0:27.700" end="0:28.090">wish</span> <span begin="0:28.090" end="0:28.210">you</span> <span begin="0:28.210" end="0:29.650">well?</span></p><p begin="0:29.830" end="0:34.630" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.830" end="0:30.070">How</span> <span begin="0:30.070" end="0:30.580">many</span> <span begin="0:30.580" end="0:32.080">times</span> <span begin="0:32.080" end="